        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Beecarbonize",
        "extract": "Beecarbonize is a 2023 free-to-play real time card-based simulation video game. It was developed by Prague-based studio Charles Games in association with People In Need, and being part of the 1PLANET4ALL project.\nThe game was released for iOS and Android in March 2023, and for Windows and macOS in August 2023.\nThe game was shortlisted for the 2023 awards of The Independent Game Developers' Association.\n\n",
